#!/usr/bin/env beg

Accept a source directory and one or more backup directories.
Check regular files recursively. A source file is covered if any file in any
backup has the same bytes, regardless of its name, path, or modification time.

Group uncovered source files that have identical contents. Print one JSON array
of source-relative paths per group, sorted by path within and across groups.
Exit 0 if every file is covered, 1 if there are gaps, or 2 on a read error.
